# LuxMini device profile — copy to:
#   ~/Library/Application Support/LuxMini/profile
# Format (one active line):  KEY FORMAT MAX
#   KEY    = 4-char SMC key for your Mac's front LED
#   FORMAT = vv (write [v,v], most models) | v0 (write [v,0], older Intel case-LED)
#   MAX    = device max brightness (usually 255)
# The real per-model keys are provided by the device-profile service (see README);
# this example ships a placeholder only.
XXXX vv 255
